---
interface Props { kind: 'entry' | 'rpm' | 'landing' }
const { kind } = Astro.props;
const figures = {
 entry: {
  title: 'Entry: choose the starting condition', legend: 'Engine failure starts from…', source: '11-3–11-4; 7-3',
  states: [
   { label: 'Cruise', heading: 'Collective down · aft cyclic · trim', pitch: -10, x: 205, y: 100, path: 'M70 150 Q180 130 300 145 T550 220', arrow: 'M330 105 H455', text: 'Lower collective immediately. Apply aft cyclic with trim to prevent the nose dropping and help preserve rotor rpm; then establish the recommended autorotation airspeed.' },
   { label: 'High hover / slow', heading: 'Collective down · forward cyclic · accelerate', pitch: 13, x: 205, y: 100, path: 'M100 70 Q100 175 260 210 T550 245', arrow: 'M330 105 H395', text: 'Lower collective immediately. From a high hover, lower the nose to gain autorotation airspeed. The acceleration costs height; a low, slow start may not leave enough.' },
   { label: 'Low and fast', heading: 'Little height · little time', pitch: -10, x: 205, y: 210, path: 'M70 230 Q260 225 370 245 T550 265', arrow: 'M330 205 H475', text: 'A high-speed failure close to the ground leaves little time to react and flare. Excessive nose-high attitude risks a tail strike; excessive touchdown speed brings its own danger. Use the type’s emergency procedure.' },
  ],
 },
 rpm: {
  title: 'Collective: which way does rotor rpm move?', legend: 'Change collective during an established autorotation', source: '11-3–11-4',
  states: [
   { label: 'Lower', heading: 'Less blade pitch → rotor rpm rises', pitch: 0, x: 205, y: 130, path: '', arrow: 'M420 220 V100', text: 'Lowering collective reduces blade pitch and increases rotor rpm in an established autorotation. This shows a tendency, not an rpm value or a guaranteed recovery from critically low rpm.' },
   { label: 'Balanced', heading: 'Balanced aerodynamic torque → rpm holds', pitch: 0, x: 205, y: 130, path: '', arrow: 'M375 155 H485', text: 'When driving torque balances rotor drag, rpm holds. The required collective position depends on the flight condition; “balanced” is not a fixed lever setting.' },
   { label: 'Raise', heading: 'More blade pitch → rotor rpm falls', pitch: 0, x: 205, y: 130, path: '', arrow: 'M420 100 V220', text: 'If rpm builds too high, raise collective sufficiently to return it to the normal range, then reduce collective. Holding the increase too long can cause rapid rpm decay.' },
  ],
 },
 landing: {
  title: 'Landing: follow the change in attitude and control', legend: 'Select a phase', source: '11-4–11-5',
  states: [
   { label: '1 Flare', heading: 'Aft cyclic · reduce speed and descent', pitch: -16, x: 180, y: 140, path: 'M60 80 Q230 230 530 240', arrow: 'M350 125 H445', text: 'At the manufacturer’s recommended height, aft cyclic reduces forward speed and rate of descent. Rotor rpm can build in the flare; keep it within the type’s limits.' },
   { label: '2 Level', heading: 'Forward cyclic · landing attitude', pitch: 0, x: 350, y: 220, path: 'M60 80 Q230 230 530 240', arrow: 'M460 215 H510', text: 'Move cyclic forward toward the manufacturer’s landing attitude as forward speed reduces. Carrying the nose-high flare attitude down to the surface risks a tail strike.' },
   { label: '3 Cushion', heading: 'Raise collective · spend rotor energy', pitch: 0, x: 465, y: 243, path: 'M60 80 Q230 230 530 240', arrow: 'M330 245 V190', text: 'Raise collective to cushion the remaining descent using stored rotor energy. Pulling too early can spend that energy above the ground; cushion onto the surface rather than trying to hold the helicopter airborne.' },
  ],
 },
};
const figure = figures[kind];
---
<section class="auto-figure" aria-labelledby={`${kind}-figure-title`}>
 <h3 id={`${kind}-figure-title`} class="fig-title">{figure.title}</h3>
 <fieldset>
  <legend>{figure.legend}</legend>
  {figure.states.map((state, i) => <label><input type="radio" name={`auto-${kind}`} value={i} aria-controls={`${kind}-panel-${i}`} checked={i === 0} />{state.label}</label>)}
 </fieldset>
 {figure.states.map((state, i) => <div id={`${kind}-panel-${i}`} class={`state state-${i}`}>
  <h4>{state.heading}</h4>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 300" role="img" aria-label={`${state.heading}. ${kind === 'rpm' ? 'Arrow indicates the rotor rpm tendency.' : 'Helicopter side view, nose to the right; dashed line shows a schematic flight path.'}`}>
   <defs><marker id={`${kind}-arrow-${i}`} viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="3" markerHeight="3" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" /></marker></defs>
   {kind !== 'rpm' && <><path d="M25 280 H575" class="ground" /><path d={state.path} class="flight-path" /><text x="30" y="298">GROUND</text></>}
   <g transform={`translate(${state.x} ${state.y}) rotate(${state.pitch})`}>
    <path d="M-28 0 Q-38 -22 -10 -25 H18 Q40 -20 48 2 Q25 15 -25 10 Z" class="body" />
    <path d="M-30 -3 L-95 -18 L-100 -35 M-12 -25 V-42 M-82 -42 H72 M-30 22 H42 M-20 10 V22 M28 10 V22" />
    <path d="M16 -23 L20 -4 H44" />
    <circle cx="-95" cy="-18" r="13" class="tail" />
   </g>
   {kind !== 'rpm' && <text x={kind === 'landing' && i === 2 ? 330 : 420} y={kind === 'landing' ? (i === 0 ? 105 : i === 1 ? 195 : 175) : (i === 2 ? 185 : 85)} text-anchor="middle">{kind === 'landing' && i === 2 ? 'COLLECTIVE UP' : 'FORWARD SPEED'}</text>}
   <path d={state.arrow} class="arrow" marker-end={`url(#${kind}-arrow-${i})`} />
   {kind === 'rpm' ? <text x="420" y="265" text-anchor="middle">ROTOR RPM TENDENCY</text> : <text x="370" y={kind === 'landing' ? 40 : 35} text-anchor="middle">NOSE → · PROFILE VIEW</text>}
  </svg>
  <p>{state.text}</p>
 </div>)}
 <p class="fig-caption">Schematic only: attitudes, paths and arrow lengths are illustrative. No speeds, heights, timing or performance are prescribed. <a href="#source-hfh">FAA Helicopter Flying Handbook, pp. {figure.source}</a>.</p>
</section>
<style>
 .auto-figure { margin-block: 1.75rem; border: 2px solid var(--color-text); padding: clamp(0.75rem, 2vw, 1.25rem); background: #fff; }
 fieldset { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.25rem 1rem; }
 label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; min-height: 2.75rem; cursor: pointer; }
 label:has(:checked) { font-weight: 700; }
 input { accent-color: var(--color-text); }
 .state { display: none; }
 .auto-figure:has(input[value="0"]:checked) .state-0,
 .auto-figure:has(input[value="1"]:checked) .state-1,
 .auto-figure:has(input[value="2"]:checked) .state-2 { display: block; }
 h4 { margin: 1rem 0 0.25rem; font-size: 1rem; }
 svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
 svg text { fill: currentColor; stroke: none; font: 12px sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
 .body { fill: #fff; }
 .tail { stroke-width: 1.5; }
 .flight-path { stroke: #777; stroke-dasharray: 5 7; stroke-width: 1.5; }
 .ground { stroke-width: 1; }
 .arrow { stroke-width: 4; }
 .state p { margin-top: 0.75rem; }
</style>
